Description: Ship Cargo.lock resolved with rust-i18n 3.1.5
 rust-i18n-macro 3.1.2 emits the translation tables of the editor widget's
 locales by iterating a HashMap, whose seed is random in every process, so
 each build compiles them in a different order and no rebuild matches.
 3.1.3 and later iterate a BTreeMap. This is the lock
 "cargo update -p proc-macro-crate@2.0.2" then
 "cargo update -p rust-i18n --precise 3.1.5" produced; the first frees the
 toml_datetime pin that 3.1.5's toml cannot share.
Author: pkg.haus archive <archive@pkg.haus>
Forwarded: https://github.com/rust-man-org/rustman/pull/65
Last-Update: 2026-10-20
